v 3
d gepwreg. Percentile Weights Regression with analytical standard errors
d
d Author: Araar Abdelkrim
d Universite Laval & Partnership for Economic Policy (PEP)
d Support: aabd@ecn.ulaval.ca
d
d Distribution-Date: 20260512
d
d Description:
d This package implements the Percentile Weights Regression (PWR)
d introduced by Araar (2016, 2023). It provides consistent analytical 
d standard errors (linearisation variance / functional delta method), 
d MSE-optimal bandwidth selection, and inference under complex survey design.
d
